<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5"><strong>=F0=9F=
=8E=AF Meta/Facebook: Photo Tagging Interface</strong></h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>=F0=9F=
=93=8B Problem Statement:</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><em>"Build a photo tagging compo=
nent similar to Facebook's photo tagging feature where users can tag friend=
s in uploaded photos."</em></p>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>=F0=9F=
=94=A7 Functional Requirements:</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Core Features:</strong><=
/p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Photo Upload &amp; Disp=
lay</strong>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Accept image files (JPEG, PNG, =
WebP) up to 10MB</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Display uploaded photo in a con=
tainer (max-width: 800px)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Maintain aspect ratio during re=
size</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Tagging Mechanism</stro=
ng>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Click anywhere on photo to crea=
te a tag</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Show draggable rectangle overla=
y (min: 40x40px, max: 200x200px)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Display input field for friend'=
s name when tag created</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Auto-complete friend suggestion=
s from provided dataset</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Tag Management</strong>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Maximum 20 tags per photo</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Each tag shows friend's name on=
 hover</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Delete tags v=E1=BB=9Bi right-c=
lick or delete button</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Edit tag names by clicking on e=
xisting tags</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Data Persistence</stron=
g>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Save tag coordinates as percent=
ages (for responsive design)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Store friend ID, name, v=C3=A0 =
position for each tag</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Export final tag data as JSON</=
li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>=E2=9A=
=A1 Non-Functional Requirements:</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance:</strong></p=
>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Component renders in &lt; 100ms=
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Smooth dragging at 60fps</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Debounced autocomplete (300ms d=
elay)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Lazy load friend suggestions (v=
irtual scrolling for 1000+ friends)</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Accessibility:</strong><=
/p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Keyboard navigation for tag cre=
ation (Tab + Enter)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Screen reader support v=E1=BB=
=9Bi ARIA labels</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">High contrast mode compatibilit=
y</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Focus management during tag ope=
rations</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Responsive Design:</stro=
ng></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Works on mobile (min-width: 320=
px)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Touch-friendly tag manipulation=
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Swipe gestures for tag navigati=
on on mobile</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>=F0=9F=
=9B=A0 Technical Constraints:</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Technology Stack:</stron=
g></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">React 18+ v=E1=BB=9Bi Hooks (no=
