<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">CSS Modules or Styled Component=
s (no external UI libraries)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">React Testing Library for unit =
tests</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Browser Support:</strong=
></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Chrome 90+, Firefox 88+, Safari=
