<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><em>"Build a collaborative liste=
ning session interface where multiple users can control the same playlist, =
similar to Spotify's Group Session feature."</em></p>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>=F0=9F=
=94=A7 Functional Requirements:</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Session Management:</str=
ong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Host Controls</strong>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
