<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Add songs to shared queue (if p=
ermitted)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Vote to skip current song</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">See real-time participant list =
v=E1=BB=9Bi avatars</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Leave session gracefully</li>
