all clients</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Handle network lag gracefully (=
buffer management)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Volume control (individual vs s=
ynchronized)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Democratic Features</st=
rong>
